WEBVTT

02:21:49.668 --> 02:21:53.005
Hagrid: Come on, now.
Hurry up, you'll be late.

02:21:53.213 --> 02:21:57.509
Train's leaving. Go on.
Come on, hurry up.

02:22:02.931 --> 02:22:06.226
- Come on, Harry.
- One minute.

02:22:12.441 --> 02:22:16.236
Thought you were leaving
without saying goodbye, did you?

02:22:19.448 --> 02:22:21.283
This is for you.

02:22:38.050 --> 02:22:40.177
Thanks, Hagrid.

02:22:45.974 --> 02:22:50.437
Go on. On with you. On with you now.
Oh, listen, Harry.

02:22:50.812 --> 02:22:55.317
If that dolt of a cousin of yours,
Dudley, gives you any grief...

02:22:55.567 --> 02:22:58.236
You could always threaten him...

02:22:58.445 --> 02:23:01.323
With a nice pair of ears
to go with his tail.

02:23:01.490 --> 02:23:06.620
But we're not allowed to do magic
away from Hogwarts. You know that.

02:23:07.079 --> 02:23:11.416
I do. But your cousin don't, do he?

02:23:16.922 --> 02:23:20.008
Feels strange to be going home,
doesn't it?

02:23:20.258 --> 02:23:22.344
I'm not going home.

02:23:22.511 --> 02:23:24.471
Not really.
